cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite the software and the relevant
  research publication(s) below.
title: Open CFT
type: software
abstract: >-
  A preservation and modernization repository for historical cusped-field
  thruster research code. The modern implementation currently verifies a cusp
  loss-cone kernel across Python, C++17, and optional NVIDIA Warp CPU/CUDA
  backends; it is not a complete validated plasma or magnetostatic solver.
authors:
  - family-names: Muffatti
    given-names: Angus
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-01
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/terrorproforma/open-cft
url: https://github.com/terrorproforma/open-cft
keywords:
  - cusped-field thruster
  - HEMP thruster
  - electric propulsion
  - MATLAB preservation
  - scientific software modernization
  - NVIDIA Warp
